#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/add.rst:5
msgid "Add part to element"
msgstr "向元件添加部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/add.rst:7
msgid ""
"Adding parts to the `drawing area`_ from the `element editor`_ can only be "
"done from `parts toolbar`_."
msgstr ""
"只能通过 `部件工具栏 <parts toolbar_>`_ 从 `元件编辑器 <element editor_>`_ 向 `绘图区 <drawing "
"area_>`_ 添加部件。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/add.rst:11
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > 部件** 将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/add.rst:13
msgid ""
"For more information about how to add each type of part (`Line`_, "
"`Rectangle`_, `Ellipse`_, `Arc`_, `Polygon`_, `Terminal`_, `text`_ and "
"`dynamic text field`_), refer to the `element part`_ section."
msgstr ""
"有关如何添加各类部件（`线条 <Line_>`_、`矩形 <Rectangle_>`_、`椭圆 <Ellipse_>`_、`圆弧 "
"<Arc_>`_、`多边形 <Polygon_>`_、`端子 <Terminal_>`_、`文本 <text_>`_ 和 `动态文本字段 "
"<dynamic text field_>`_ ）的更多信息，请参见 `元件部件 <element part_>`_ 一节。"
